Package: armory-crate
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: anatolijphp <anatolijphp@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-psutil, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: kmod
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/anatolijphp/armory-crate-alternative-ubuntu
Description: A Linux equivalent of ASUS Armoury Crate (sensors + Aura Sync RGB)
 Live CPU/GPU/motherboard/memory/storage/fan readings and Aura Sync RGB
 lighting for ASUS motherboards, talking to the hardware directly over its
 own USB HID interface - read-only everywhere except lighting, which is
 opcode-allow-listed and never touches device flash. GTK4/libadwaita window
 (armory-crate) plus a background Aura Sync service, armory-crated
 (systemctl --user enable --now armory-crated).
